                <u> </u>: se koi bhi line under line ho jati hai 
                <a href=" "></a>: yeh kisi bhi website ki dikhane ke liye use hota hai.
                ex: <a href="https://www.google.com/">google</a>
                <b>BOLD<b/>:yeh wala tag kisi bhi word ko bold dikhane ke liye use hota hai.
                <i>italic</i>: yeh wala tag kisi bhi word ko itali dikhane ke liye use hota hai.
                <big> </big>:yeh wala tag kisi bhi line ko bada dikhane ke liye use hota hai.
                <small> </small>:yeh wala tag kisi bhi line ko chota dikhane ke liye use hota hai.


table-table tag is a container tag in html jo humme data ko row aur column mein likhne ke liye features
provide kaarta hai.
row ke liye hum tr tag use karte hai.
for column we use td tag.
agar humme column banana ho toh humme row banana padega.
when we create a new row toh bydefault vo pehle row ke niche aayega.
agar humme brouser mein kuch bhi dikhana toh humme code body tag mein likhna padega.
when we commentoff any code then compiler only reads the code but not execute it.
name, employ id ,phone number, email.
colspan-jab bhi kisi bhi column ko humme uske just next wale column ka space lena hoga toh humme colspan lene hoga .colspan se hum next wala column ka space lelete hai.
rowspan-rowspan attribute se hum row kw just nuche wale row ka space ko hum mergekarte hai.
position in css- agar humne kisi bhi elements  ko position assume kiya toh vo element top layer mein aa jayega then humne agar usko move karvaya to apne just after ko move kiye bina space lelega.
hum position absolute tab use karte hai jab hume kisi single element ko move karvana ho lekin uss element ke karan uske next element ko koi effect na ho.
hm position absolute mein - top,left , right, bottom, properties use karte hai.
